/// Specifies that the element does not follow any offset path. The `none` value is equivalent to the
/// element not having any [offset
/// transform](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/offset). The
/// element's movement in this case is determined by its default position properties, such as `top`
/// and `left`, instead of an offset path. This is the default value.

